    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/407340/extras/83fde93c959a7171ff5bfef8a263970b.avif?t=1726557257\" /></div><br><br><i>&quot;Feed me, or I'll reap your soul!&quot;</i><br>And with those ridiculous words, my whole life was turned upside down.<br><br>Sakuraba Rie, aged nine, is a cynical and grumpy girl who doesn't get along with her classmates. Rie is so haughty, she doesn't have a single friend. This all changes, however, when a self-proclaimed demon from the deepest, darkest pits of Hell suddenly appears in her kitchen to steal a tray of cookies.<br><br>What will happen between Rie and her demonic companion? Will Rie be able to forge a friendship with Licia, the cookie-stealing demon, or perhaps something more?<br><br>That's up for the reader to decide!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/407340/extras/fc2bb9ca48e8d1f3e52b6b89ff2fad70.avif?t=1726557257\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>80k worth of text (approx 4-7 hours of reading)<br></li><li>An interactive story with numerous choices and endings<br></li><li>A romance or friendship ending with your cute demon companion<br></li><li>Expressive character sprites with multiple pretty outfits<br></li><li>Lots and lots of mouth-watering, high-quality images of food<br></li><li>One cute demon girl<br></li><li>One grumpy tsundere<br></li><li>Even more images of food! \u2665 </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/407340/extras/83fde93c959a7171ff5bfef8a263970b.avif?t=1726557257\" /></div><br><br><i>&quot;Feed me, or I'll reap your soul!&quot;</i><br>And with those ridiculous words, my whole life was turned upside down.<br><br>Sakuraba Rie, aged nine, is a cynical and grumpy girl who doesn't get along with her classmates. Rie is so haughty, she doesn't have a single friend. This all changes, however, when a self-proclaimed demon from the deepest, darkest pits of Hell suddenly appears in her kitchen to steal a tray of cookies.<br><br>What will happen between Rie and her demonic companion? Will Rie be able to forge a friendship with Licia, the cookie-stealing demon, or perhaps something more?<br><br>That's up for the reader to decide!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/407340/extras/fc2bb9ca48e8d1f3e52b6b89ff2fad70.avif?t=1726557257\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>80k worth of text (approx 4-7 hours of reading)<br></li><li>An interactive story with numerous choices and endings<br></li><li>A romance or friendship ending with your cute demon companion<br></li><li>Expressive character sprites with multiple pretty outfits<br></li><li>Lots and lots of mouth-watering, high-quality images of food<br></li><li>One cute demon girl<br></li><li>One grumpy tsundere<br></li><li>Even more images of food! \u2665 </li></ul>",
